{"id": 19332, "title": "Lily learns Chinese", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "lily-learns-chinese", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/19332_lily-learns-chinese.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["Lily是一个法国人，李丽是她的中文名字。她在法国学习中文。她有两个来自中国的中文老师，一个是男老师，一个是女老师。他们一起上课，一起说汉语，也一起喝咖啡、看电影，变成了很好的朋友。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["Lily是一個法國人，李麗是她的中文名字。她在法國學習中文。她有兩個來自中國的中文老師，一個是男老師，一個是女老師。他們一起上課，一起說漢語，也一起喝咖啡、看電影，變成了很好的朋友。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["Lily shì yī gè Fǎ guó rén， Lǐ Lì shì tā de Zhōng wén míng zi。 tā zài Fǎ guó xué xí Zhōng wén。 tā yǒu liǎng gè lái zì Zhōng guó de Zhōng wén lǎo shī， yī gè shì nán lǎo shī， yī gè shì nǚ lǎo shī。 tā men yī qǐ shàng kè， yī qǐ shuō Hàn yǔ， yě yī qǐ hē kā fēi、 kàn diàn yǐng， biàn chéng le hěn hǎo de péng you。"], "english_paragraphs": ["Lily is a French person, and Li Li is her Chinese name. She studied Chinese in France. She has two Chinese teachers from China, one is a male teacher and the other is a female teacher. They took classes together, spoke Chinese together, drank coffee and watched movies together, and became very good friends."], "english_full": "Lily is a French person, and Li Li is her Chinese name. She studied Chinese in France. She has two Chinese teachers from China, one is a male teacher and the other is a female teacher. They took classes together, spoke Chinese together, drank coffee and watched movies together, and became very good friends.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">L</span><span class=\"tr\">L</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">i</span><span class=\"tr\">i</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">l</span><span class=\"tr\">l</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">y</span><span class=\"tr\">y</span><rt></rt></ruby>